{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8599b7763963d7f6cf470cb70d2655909d3e69fdfc58e82c3bc2246f0142ece5","digest":{"component_or_area":"reconciler read/check operation paths","key_entities":["src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/runtime.py","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend_registry.py","ReconcilerSettings","GitRuntime","BridgeRuntime","reconcile-check","load_config()","SecretStr","SecretBytes"],"problem_keywords":["reconciler","read paths","immutable settings","ambient reload","config scope","jira backend","static binding"],"propositions":["Reconciler read/check paths currently call load_config() and inspect ambient environment/cwd state, allowing configuration and read scope to change during a single operation run.","Backend composition must be cut over to use immutable ReconcilerSettings and focused runtime projections, constructed once from S1 snapshot, such that backend properties (project/query/TLS/timeout/limits/tracker layout) remain stable regardless of subsequent environment mutations.","All read/check call paths—preflight, access check, fetch, paging, diff, mapper, sanitizer, tracker/binding reads, and Git ref/layout ownership—must thread the same stable backend/runtime without ambient reloads.","Static sensitive fields (SecretStr/SecretBytes) must be excluded from repr/equality/hash/cache/fingerprint and unwrapped only in the selected Jira sending adapter, with canaries verifying no secret leakage across carriers, diagnostics, and wire boundaries.","Exactly one selected Jira Cloud or Data Center backend must be constructed from supplied bindings; unselected provider, missing/conflicting auth, and empty/malformed scope must fail before any Jira model request or local write."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787542040569009001,"uuid":"a837915f-d777-4fc9-b776-4744f8193e83"}